  "description": "Claim-check middleware for oversized message payloads: an outbound middleware offloads a serialized body that exceeds a configured threshold to a pluggable IClaimCheckStore and carries an opaque reference on the benzene-claim-check header; an inbound middleware hydrates the reference back to the real body before deserialization. Ships an in-memory store for tests and local development - production stores (S3, Azure Blob Storage) ship as separate packages.",
